cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite the SORT4CIRC DPP Development Guidelines and reference implementation.
title: SORT4CIRC DPP Development Guidelines and reference implementation
abstract: >-
  A public technical implementation profile for a textile Digital Product Passport,
  with a versioned JSON Schema, controlled vocabularies, an RDF/OWL semantic model,
  JSON/XML/RDF mappings, an OpenAPI exchange contract, identifier and data-carrier
  guidance, an optional integrity profile, a Python reference implementation,
  synthetic worked examples and a conformance test suite. This is repository release
  1.3.0, which implements the SORT4CIRC DPP implementation profile 1.0.0; the two
  version numbers are independent. The specification originates in SORT4CIRC Horizon
  Europe project deliverable D4.3, "DPP Development Guidelines". All distributed
  examples and identifiers are synthetic or demonstrative.
type: software
version: 1.3.0
date-released: 2026-09-09
